[:db/add "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/id #uuid "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef"] [:db/add "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/problem "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=6 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}},\\qquad 3 x + 1>0\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=2 \\ln{\\left(3 x + 1 \\right)}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=\\frac{6}{3 x + 1}.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation."] [:db/add "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. Differentiating $f(x)=2 \\ln{\\left(3 x + 1 \\right)},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(2 \\ln{\\left(3 x + 1 \\right)}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=2\\cdot\\frac{3}{3 x + 1} \\\\ &=\\frac{6}{3 x + 1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. Substituting $y=2 \\ln{\\left(3 x + 1 \\right)}$ and $y\\prime=\\frac{6}{3 x + 1}$ into the original equation gives an identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}6 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}} \\\\ \\frac{6}{3 x + 1} &\\overset{?}{=}6e^{-(2 \\ln{\\left(3 x + 1 \\right)})/(2)} \\\\ \\frac{6}{3 x + 1} &\\overset{?}{=}6e^{-\\ln(3 x + 1)} \\\\ \\frac{6}{3 x + 1} &=\\frac{6}{3 x + 1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the function $y=2 \\ln{\\left(3 x + 1 \\right)}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""] [:db/add "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/answer-fields "54de8a04-1471-5f5a-8ae7-f7320ab59390"] [:db/add "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/answer-fields "45ade0d2-ac27-5c73-9ad6-3be99c3f833b"] [:db/add "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/answer-fields "51558782-e603-5130-857e-3b7d5a1aea98"] [:db/ensure "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/questions "ea016ba9-b08a-5130-a64c-616daed418ef"] [:db/add "08d20a70-a6e3-569b-b70c-91a2deeda071" :answer/id #uuid "08d20a70-a6e3-569b-b70c-91a2deeda071"] [:db/add "08d20a70-a6e3-569b-b70c-91a2deeda071" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "08d20a70-a6e3-569b-b70c-91a2deeda071" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "08d20a70-a6e3-569b-b70c-91a2deeda071" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5f954ee0-b77e-54d7-9d1a-aeab4c66066f" :answer/id #uuid "5f954ee0-b77e-54d7-9d1a-aeab4c66066f"] [:db/add "5f954ee0-b77e-54d7-9d1a-aeab4c66066f" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "5f954ee0-b77e-54d7-9d1a-aeab4c66066f" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "5f954ee0-b77e-54d7-9d1a-aeab4c66066f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1"] [:db/add "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1" :answer-field/key "I"] [:db/add "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1" :answer-field/choices "08d20a70-a6e3-569b-b70c-91a2deeda071"] [:db/add "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1" :answer-field/choices "5f954ee0-b77e-54d7-9d1a-aeab4c66066f"] [:db/add "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1" :answer-field/correct "08d20a70-a6e3-569b-b70c-91a2deeda071"] [:db/ensure "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "68427cdb-4aa1-5bed-8af1-4c431730eaf8" :answer/id #uuid "68427cdb-4aa1-5bed-8af1-4c431730eaf8"] [:db/add "68427cdb-4aa1-5bed-8af1-4c431730eaf8" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "68427cdb-4aa1-5bed-8af1-