er-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "be5959c5-b6f6-521b-a0a7-8f8644029a7d" :answer-field/choices "13d2d4d3-772d-5fea-ab1e-f5d3a2ca4c1d"] [:db/add "be5959c5-b6f6-521b-a0a7-8f8644029a7d" :answer-field/choices "fdb92550-d578-5696-a651-e77116f131ae"] [:db/add "be5959c5-b6f6-521b-a0a7-8f8644029a7d" :answer-field/correct "fdb92550-d578-5696-a651-e77116f131ae"] [:db/ensure "be5959c5-b6f6-521b-a0a7-8f8644029a7d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/id #uuid "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b"] [:db/add "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/problem "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=9 e^{- \\frac{y}{3}},\\qquad 3 x - 3>0\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=3 \\ln{\\left(3 x - 3 \\right)}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=\\frac{12}{3 x - 3}.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation."] [:db/add "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Differentiating $f(x)=3 \\ln{\\left(3 x - 3 \\right)},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(3 \\ln{\\left(3 x - 3 \\right)}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=3\\cdot\\frac{3}{3 x - 3} \\\\ &=\\frac{9}{3 x - 3} \\\\ &\\not\\equiv \\frac{12}{3 x - 3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. Substituting $y=3 \\ln{\\left(3 x - 3 \\right)}$ and $y\\prime=\\frac{9}{3 x - 3}$ into the original equation gives an identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}9 e^{- \\frac{y}{3}} \\\\ \\frac{9}{3 x - 3} &\\overset{?}{=}9e^{-(3 \\ln{\\left(3 x - 3 \\right)})/(3)} \\\\ \\frac{9}{3 x - 3} &\\overset{?}{=}9e^{-\\ln(3 x - 3)} \\\\ \\frac{9}{3 x - 3} &=\\frac{3}{x - 1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the function $y=3 \\ln{\\left(3 x - 3 \\right)}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""] [:db/add "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/answer-fields "7c50a45c-a4d9-5db9-94cb-598f6ea148d1"] [:db/add "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/answer-fields "6452302d-8c93-54b4-bd74-909afc8a339a"] [:db/add "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/answer-fields "be5959c5-b6f6-521b-a0a7-8f8644029a7d"] [:db/ensure "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/questions "e4dd22fb-4eb9-516a-a3b0-458ee206af3b"] [:db/add "2d576c80-7571-50d0-bc26-368ad4cb8fba" :answer/id #uuid "2d576c80-7571-50d0-bc26-368ad4cb8fba"] [:db/add "2d576c80-7571-50d0-bc26-368ad4cb8fba" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "2d576c80-7571-50d0-bc26-368ad4cb8fba" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "2d576c80-7571-50d0-bc26-368ad4cb8fba" :answer/validate] [:db/add "42fb3203-d6f2-5685-9a07-82e33c2e8163" :answer/id #uuid "42fb3203-d6f2-5685-9a07-82e33c2e8163"] [:db/add "42fb3203-d6f2-5685-9a07-82e33c2e8163" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "42fb3203-d6f2-5685-9a07-82e33c2e8163" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "42fb3203-d6f2-5685-9a07-82e33c2e8163" :answer/validate] [:db/add "61085ad0-ae6c-5fc4-974f-fb93aeef646c" :answer-field/id #uuid "61085ad0-ae6c-5fc4-974f-fb93aeef646c"] [:db/add "61085ad0-ae6c-5fc4-974f-fb93aeef646c" :answer-field/key "I"] [:db/add "61085ad0-ae6c-5fc4-974f-fb93aeef646c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "61085ad0-ae6c-5fc4-974f-fb93aeef646c" :answer-field/choices "2d576c80-7571-50d0-bc26-368ad4cb8fba"] [:db/add "61085ad0-ae6c-5f