cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/id #uuid "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa"] [:db/add "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/problem "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=8 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}},\\qquad 4 x - 1>0\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=2 \\ln{\\left(4 x - 1 \\right)}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=\\frac{8}{4 x - 1}.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation."] [:db/add "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. Differentiating $f(x)=2 \\ln{\\left(4 x - 1 \\right)},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(2 \\ln{\\left(4 x - 1 \\right)}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=2\\cdot\\frac{4}{4 x - 1} \\\\ &=\\frac{8}{4 x - 1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. Substituting $y=2 \\ln{\\left(4 x - 1 \\right)}$ and $y\\prime=\\frac{8}{4 x - 1}$ into the original equation gives an identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}8 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}} \\\\ \\frac{8}{4 x - 1} &\\overset{?}{=}8e^{-(2 \\ln{\\left(4 x - 1 \\right)})/(2)} \\\\ \\frac{8}{4 x - 1} &\\overset{?}{=}8e^{-\\ln(4 x - 1)} \\\\ \\frac{8}{4 x - 1} &=\\frac{8}{4 x - 1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the function $y=2 \\ln{\\left(4 x - 1 \\right)}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""] [:db/add "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/answer-fields "8ad95109-0cc0-5d78-83ab-75d8e54829d8"] [:db/add "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/answer-fields "6d72eff3-71f9-5ab8-bb2e-d070834ba15b"] [:db/add "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/answer-fields "a4f3d032-bbe2-53bc-8f58-067bf98bacb8"] [:db/ensure "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/questions "cb9ae8f4-b827-5abd-a900-f65d110847aa"] [:db/ensure 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/validate]]
